  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Armed with a formal business plan, Kawada and Muranishi sit down at a Tokyo bank to request a production loan. When the stiff loan officer scoffs at financing adult videos, they ask about his VCR at home and get an honest confession. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ポルノビデオを作る金を融資しろと？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ええ、はい。あの、失礼ですがご自宅にビデオデッキは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ありますよ。家族で洋画を見るのが好きなので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "この世で一番多く見られてる作品のジャンルはポルノなんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まあ、当然ですよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ビデオの普及はポルノが支えてますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "実感としてはどうですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ポルノ、見てるんでしょ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "確かに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、すけべだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please have a look at our proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ポルノビデオを作る金を融資しろと？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You expect us to finance money to make adult videos?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ええ、はい。あの、失礼ですがご自宅にビデオデッキは？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, that's right. Excuse me for asking, do you have a VCR at home?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "ありますよ。家族で洋画を見るのが好きなので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do. My family enjoys watching Western movies together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "この世で一番多く見られてる作品のジャンルはポルノなんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The single most-watched genre in the entire world is adult video.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まあ、当然ですよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, it's only natural when you think about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ビデオの普及はポルノが支えてますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because the spread of home video is supported by adult titles.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "実感としてはどうですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Speaking from personal experience, how does that ring true?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ポルノ、見てるんでしょ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You watch them yourself, don't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tencho",
      "t": "確かに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I certainly do.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "いや、すけべだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well now, what a rascal!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We look forward to working with you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
